      "description": "一般頁面的直角硬鍵；專業端沿用配色、字體與邊框，取消陰影。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-ghost\" type=\"button\">查看紀錄</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:48px;min-width:44px;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid var(--line-2,#728eb8);border-radius:0;font:400 17px/1.4 var(--pixel,\"Cubic 11\",system-ui,sans-serif);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--px-drop,#061027);cursor:pointer;transition:background 180ms ease-out,transform 150ms ease-out;background:var(--card,#14294d);color:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);} .ds-button-ghost:hover{filter:none;border-color:var(--line-2,#728eb8);} .ds-button-ghost:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#92c9ff);outline-offset:4px;} .ds-button-ghost:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:1px 1px 0 var(--px-drop,#061027);} .ds-button-ghost:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed;box-shadow:none;} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-ghost:active{transform:none;} .ds-button-ghost{transition:background-color 120ms var(--ease-out,cubic-bezier(.2,0,0,1));}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "文字動作",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "低強度的補充操作，維持可點高度與鍵盤焦點。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-text\" type=\"button\">查看說明</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-text{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;min-width:44px;padding:8px 10px;border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);font:400 17px/1.4 var(--pixel,\"Cubic 11\",system-ui,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;box-shadow:none;transition:background 180ms ease-out,transform 150ms ease-out;} .ds-button-text:hover{background:var(--paper-2,#1b3458);} .ds-button-text:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#92c9ff);outline-offset:4px;} .ds-button-text:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-text:active{transform:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "文字輸入",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "系統黑體、面板底與清楚外框；輸入內容不使用像素字。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">搜尋工單<input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"輸入關鍵字\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:grid;gap:6px;color:var(--ink-2,#d2e0f3);font:400 16px/1.65 var(--font,system-ui,sans-serif);} .ds-input{min-height:48px;min-width:0;padding:10px 12px;border:2px solid var(--line-2,#728eb8);border-radius:0;background:var(--card,#14294d);color:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);font:400 16px/1.65 var(--font,system-ui,sans-serif);caret-color:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);transition:border-color .15s;} .ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#b8cbe5);opacity:1;} .ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--line-2,#728eb8);} .ds-input:focus{border-color:var(--blue,#92c9ff);box-shadow:none;} .ds-input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#92c9ff);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "頂部導航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "實色導航與像素標籤；目前入口反白。手機另使用固定底部分頁列。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主要導航\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#/\" aria-current=\"page\">首頁</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#/try\">體驗</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#/company\">企業</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0;padding:8px;background:var(--paper,#0d1b3d);border-bottom:3px solid var(--line-2,#728eb8);font:400 16px/1.65 var(--pixel,\"Cubic 11\",system-ui,sans-serif);} .ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px;border-radius:0;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted,#b8cbe5);transition:background .15s,color .15s;} .ds-nav-link:hover{background:var(--paper-2,#1b3458);color:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);} .ds-nav-link[aria-current]{background:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);color:var(--paper,#0d1b3d);} .ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#92c9ff);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "篩選項",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "可點篩選項以反白表示選取，與純狀態標籤區分。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">全部</button>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;padding:5px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line,#365173);border-radius:0;background:var(--card,#14294d);color:var(--ink-2,#d2e0f3);font:400 16px/1.65 var(--pixel,\"Cubic 11\",system-ui,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background 180ms ease-out,transform 150ms ease-out;} .ds-chip:hover{border-color:var(--line-2,#728eb8);} .ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#92c9ff);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "已選篩選項",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-selected",
      "description": "可點篩選項以反白表示選取，與純狀態標籤區分。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-chip-selected\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button>",
      "css": ".ds-chip-selected{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;padding:5px 12px;border:1px solid var(--ink,#f2f7ff);border-radius:0;background:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);color:var(--paper,#0d1b3d);font:400 16px/1.65 var(--pixel,\"Cubic 11\",system-ui,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background 180ms ease-out,transform 150ms ease-out;} .ds-chip-selected:hover{border-color:var(--line-2,#728eb8);} .ds-chip-selected:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#92c9ff);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "任務面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "task-card",
      "description": "一般工作內容的直角面板；專業端與巢狀面板取消陰影。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-task-card\"><h3 class=\"ds-task-title\">工單 #0142</h3><p class=\"ds-task-copy\">青年市集</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-task-card{padding:24px;border:2px solid var(--line-2,#728eb8);border-radius:0;background:var(--card,#14294d);color:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--px-drop,#061027);} .ds-task-title{margin:0;font:400 22px/1.35 var(--pixel,\"Cubic 11\",system-ui,sans-serif);} .ds-task-copy{margin:8px 0 0;font:400 16px/1.65 var(--font,system-ui,sans-serif);color:var(--ink-2,#d2e0f3);} @media(max-width:760px){.ds-task-card{padding:16px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "完成回饋",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "feedback-good",
      "description": "青綠回饋表面，標題與文字說明共同呈現完成狀態。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-feedback\" role=\"status\"><b class=\"ds-feedback-title\">已完成</b><p class=\"ds-feedback-copy\">查看你的體驗紀錄。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-feedback{padding:16px;border:2px solid var(--teal,#73e1c6);border-radius:0;background:var(--teal-soft,#163e43);color:var(--ink,#f2f7ff);} .ds-feedback-title{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font:400 28px/1.3 var(--pixel,\"Cubic 11\",system-ui,sans-serif);} .ds-feedback-copy{margin:0;font:400 16px/1.65 var(--font,system-ui,sans-serif);} @media(max-width:760px){.ds-feedback{padding:14px;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "像素城市・任務板",
    "overview": "臺北城市是共同場景，工作任務以直角框、像素標題、關卡點與角色對話呈現。深色預設如夜間城市，白天模式採藍白表面；內文維持清楚的系統黑體。企業與市府介面沿用同一套字體與框線，但收斂陰影及裝飾，讓回答、紀錄與指標保持主角。\n\n本文件記錄已實作的視覺系統。執行時來源為 `assets/css/city.css`；`index.html` 依序載入 `app.css` → `pixel.css` → `finals.css` → `city.css`，最後一層承載 C 版視覺覆寫。新增畫面沿用此順序，勿直接恢復早期樣式表中的圓角、舊色票與專業端字體。產品事實與示範聲明以 `PRODUCT.md` 為準。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "深夜藍與藍白兩套城市表面。",
      "Cubic 11 負責標題、按鈕、導航與數字；系統黑體負責閱讀。",
      "直角粗框、沒有模糊的硬陰影、黃色主要行動。",
      "青綠表達已完成與正確；專業端以較平靜的列表與表格呈現。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Theme Exceptions Rule",
        "body": "QR 圖碼與安靜區固定白底；頂部原型提示列在白天仍為深色實底配淺色文字。這些是掃碼及閱讀所需的局部例外，不由一般面板色覆蓋。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Readable Body Rule",
        "body": "主要內文至少 16px，像素字限於辨識與操作層；長段落使用系統黑體。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Professional Rule",
        "body": "企業、市府等專業頁的卡片、面板與按鈕取消投影，仍保留直角與結構框。巢狀卡片不重複加陰影。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 以最後載入的 city.css 為執行時視覺來源，使用既有語意變數與深淺色覆寫。",
      "**Do** 保留至少 16px 的主要內文、44px 觸控目標、清楚焦點及安全區。",
      "**Do** 讓主要行動用黃、正確與完成用青綠，並以文字補充狀態。",
      "**Do** 保留 QR 白底、原型提示與非市府核發的示範說明。",
      "**Do** 使用既有城市 SVG、像素頭像與本地字型，專業端收斂陰影。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 引入米白奶油底、紫粉漸層、玻璃面板或模糊軟陰影。",
      "**Don't** 把長段內文改成過小像素字，或把所有內容改成重複圓角卡片。",
      "**Don't** 使用 emoji 取代既有圖示，或增加滿版與循環裝飾動畫。",
      "**Don't** 把 CLEAR、青綠結果、QR 或示範紀錄呈現成官方核發徽章。"
    ]
  }
}
